  <h1 class="article-title">Dr. Lars von Kolzenberg</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>I build physics-based battery models and the methods to parametrize them: electrochemical-thermal cell models, reduced-order models, impedance analysis. My PhD was on how operating conditions drive SEI growth. Since then I have worked on aging analysis, cell design and swelling at a cell manufacturer, and today I develop battery models at Breathe.</p>
    <p>Charge Tanks is where I write down, from scratch, how I think about cells. It is a notebook, not a product.</p>
  </div>
