        <p>New models and parametrization methods for electrochemical-thermal cell description, unified across teams. Coordinated new product development from customer requirements through measurement protocols and data pipelines to model structure. Set up an EIS pipeline for parameter extraction and drove the validation of a reduced-order, bottom-up model. Breathe's model products: <a href="https://docs.breathebatteries.com/breathe-simulate-documentation/product_overview/">Breathe Simulate</a> and Breathe Discover.</p>
